      "aboutEvent": "GLORY'26 : The Big Line-Up !\n\nTHE BIG LINE-UP! | GLORIX 1st Anniversary\nOne Night. One Stage. 20+ Artists. Unlimited Energy.\n\nThis isn't just another music event—it's a celebration of a movement.\n\nAfter an incredible year of building one of Delhi NCR's fastest-growing underground music communities, GLORIX is back with its biggest event ever. Join us as we celebrate our 1st Anniversary with an unforgettable night featuring 20+ of the hottest underground rappers, singers, DJs, and performers from across the scene.\n\nFrom hard-hitting rap sets and melodic live performances to explosive DJ sets, every minute of the night is designed to keep the energy at its peak. Whether you're a hardcore hip-hop fan or simply love discovering fresh talent, this is the place to be.\n\nWhat Awaits You?\n\n🎤 20+ Live Performances\n🔥 Non-stop Hip-Hop, Rap & Live Music\n🎧 High-Energy DJ Sets\n💡 Massive Stage Production with Professional Lights & Sound\n📸 Instagram-Worthy Photo Spots\n🎁 Brand Giveaways & Surprise Hampers\n🍔 Food & Beverage Stalls\n🤝 Meet Artists, Creators & Music Lovers\n⚡ An Electric Crowd & Unmatched Vibes\nExpect raw talent, unforgettable performances, surprise moments, and an atmosphere you'll be talking about long after the night ends.\n\nEvent Details\n\n📅 Date: 31 July 2026 (Friday)\n🕕 Time: Gates Open at 4:00 PM\n📍 Venue: Start Studios, Ghitorni, New Delhi\n\nTickets\n\n🎟️ General Admission & VIP Passes Available\nBook early—ticket prices increase as phases sell out.\nWhether you're coming with your crew or flying solo, you'll leave with new memories, new favourite artists, and an experience unlike any other.\n\nThis is more than an event. It's where the next generation of artists takes the stage.\nSee you in the crowd.\nSee you at GLORY.",
